# Play check 2 (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5): twelve Marines of bench_200, whose paths are searched in one step. A box over the units,
# a right click away from them (the camera centred on the box, then on the target, so that each fits the narrowest
# logical screen, 640 wide: the box and the target lie 710 apart), the game's steps until 140; then play_tail.kps's
# checks. tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission scenarios/bench_200
video originals

wait game
wait frames 3
mark start
log start tick creep.tiles units:0 units:1 units:2 units:3 units:4 units:5 units:6 units:7
camera 1255 1360 &
press world 990 1350 &
release world 1520 1370
log box selected
expect selected == 12
wait tick >= 2
camera 1700 1150 &
rclick world 1700 1150
wait tick >= 140
include play_tail.kps
